Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:12px">Camera translating along its optical axis</div>

<div style="display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap">
  <button id="btnMode3d" class="active">3‑D camera strip</button>
