   image rect: far  vert. edge   → CylinderGeometry(r=0.019) behind     black
   image rect: 2 face diagonals  → CylinderGeometry(r=0.019)            black
   image-plane midline (z=0)     → CylinderGeometry(r=0.022)            grey #808080
   5 identical frusta            → clones of the group, x = 0,3.2,6.4,9.6,12.8
   moving camera (optional)      → same group, colour #1565c0, x = 3.2·t
   6 motion arrows               → Cylinder shaft(r=0.098) + Cone head(0.44/0.235) red
   scene points (optional)       → SphereGeometry(0.07)                 dark grey
